---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="The Brunel Engine" description="Turn frustrations into actionable insight through structured interviews">
  <article class="brunel">
    <h1>The Brunel Engine</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Turn frustrations into actionable insight.</p>

    <section class="overview">
      <p>
        A structured interview that generates a private report. You talk to it about your problem.
        It asks good questions. It generates analysis only you see.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>How It Works</h2>
      <div class="flow">
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-number">1</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Welcome</h3>
            <p>Sets expectations. Notes privacy. This works best when you're serious.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-number">2</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Interview</h3>
            <p>Six structured questions about your problem, its impact, what you've tried, your constraints, what solved looks like, and your commitment level.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-number">3</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Report</h3>
            <p>Private analysis with a summary, core issue identification, and three pathways forward: quick win, structural fix, and adaptation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-number">4</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Follow-up</h3>
            <p>Optional check-ins at 1 month and 1 year. Track whether things actually changed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Tiers</h2>
      <div class="tiers">
        <div class="tier">
          <h3>Basic</h3>
          <span class="price">Free</span>
          <p>Single model analysis. Clear summary and pathways.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tier">
          <h3>Standard</h3>
          <span class="price">10p</span>
          <p>Enhanced analysis with multiple perspectives. Deeper structural insight.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tier featured">
          <h3>Council</h3>
          <span class="price">50p</span>
          <p>Multi-model synthesis. Analyst, pragmatist, and contrarian views. Strategic consensus.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="pricing-note">Prices cover API costs only. No profit.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Why This Design</h2>
      <dl>
        <dt>Private reports</dt>
        <dd>No one sees this but you. No social pressure. No performance. Just you and the analysis.</dd>

        <dt>Seriousness calibration</dt>
        <dd>The commitment question isn't gatekeeping&mdash;it's calibration. Venting is valid. Acting requires different advice than exploring.</dd>

        <dt>Long follow-up</dt>
        <dd>1 month and 1 year check-ins create actual data on what works. Most tools never follow up.</dd>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="cta">
      <p class="coming-soon">Coming soon.</p>
      <p>
        The Brunel Engine is under active development.
        Follow <a href="https://twitter.com/MattKilcoyne" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@MattKilcoyne</a> for updates.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .brunel {
    padding: 2rem 0;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: #58a6ff;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #8b949e;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .overview {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  section {
    margin: 3rem 0;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: #c9d1d9;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: #58a6ff;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  p {
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  a {
    color: #58a6ff;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .flow {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .step-number {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #161b22;
    border: 1px solid #30363d;
    color: #58a6ff;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .tiers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .tier {
    border: 1px solid #30363d;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: #161b22;
  }

  .tier.featured {
    border-color: #58a6ff;
  }

  .price {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #c9d1d9;
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .pricing-note {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #8b949e;
  }

  dl {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  dt {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #c9d1d9;
  }

  dd {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0 0;
    color: #8b949e;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid #30363d;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #161b22;
  }

  .coming-soon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #58a6ff;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .tiers {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
